          "id": "09b36372-7d81-407d-a8b3-6764d72eba1a",
          "memory": "User and Devon planned pizza at Rosa's on Oak Street around 6:30 PM on Friday, October 9, 2026, craving thin-crust margherita. They agreed to meet at Rosa's, park in the back lot, text when leaving work, and whoever arrives first will grab a table.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "2e88ac89-eaa8-4e10-a136-339f8800685f",
          "memory": "On October 6, 2026 Devon said he talked to his mom that morning, she asked about User and is doing lunch again the weekend of October 10-11, 2026 with extra potato salad just in case. User said to tell her User loves her and User might stop by after noon-ish.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "9babc4bb-86a5-4852-8aa0-147f2f92b9a2",
          "memory": "On October 6, 2026 User's cat was sitting on User's clean laundry, continuing their tradition of cats choosing only clean laundry never dirty, while Devon's female cat was screaming when Devon got home and Devon gave her treats to calm her down.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "0df78ab8-4e4d-4a96-a1bc-41cbc7311c56",
          "memory": "On October 6, 2026 User's boss tried to get User to stay late again but User refused and left on time, with Devon noting User works too many late nights. Devon said he has no chart hell that week and thinks he can leave work on time Friday for pizza.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "264a07d7-5d05-46dd-b728-cb952b33c11b",
          "memory": "On October 6, 2026 Devon planned to have just toast again for dinner and said peanut butter toast is elite, while User had leftover tomato soup to finish before it went bad.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "c8cb1d0a-fccc-46ef-8d87-430a401b960c",
          "memory": "On October 6, 2026 Devon said he is postponing laundry until October 7, 2026 and still has clean socks for once, which User teased as growth and an adulting win.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "dd088f5c-e849-434e-9578-b4e6bc689159",
          "memory": "On October 6, 2026 Devon confirmed he did the quick grocery run with his mom on Saturday, October 3, 2026 but is low on snacks again, and User also said User still needs to go grocery shopping for snacks.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "792df913-d053-4707-98fe-914668c8555d",
          "memory": "On October 6, 2026 User and Devon both sat through traffic on 5th by the bank with cones everywhere. User said User should have taken Oak instead, and Devon said he was too lazy to reroute.",
          "event": "ADD"
        }
      ]
    },
